  <item nodeId="node-0x56436d18aea0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">- start -</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">



You are Jim Holden, Captain of the infamous Rocinante. You sit on the bridge, head aching and mouth tasting of sour copper. Standing with a groan you say, &quot;Alex, bridge is yours I need a coffee. Want me to grab you one?&quot; Alex replies, &quot;Copy that cap, but I&apos;ll pass on the cuppa, thanks&quot;
The Expanse - Coffee Time on the Rocinante
An Interactive Fiction by Zachary Geary
Release 1 / Serial number 260414 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D

Bridge
Description.

&gt;</result>
