  <item nodeId="node-0x56436bf3c2a0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go down</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You slide down the rungs to the deck below...

Armory
A secure room filled with MCRN-issue lockers. The airlock to the north leads to the vacuum of space.

&gt;</result>
